WEBVTT

00:03:59.756 --> 00:04:01.356
and the power that you purchase.

00:04:02.036 --> 00:04:03.036
In the UK,

00:04:03.036 --> 00:04:05.676
the advertising association has estimated

00:04:05.676 --> 00:04:09.636
that the entire carbon footprint
of the UK ad industry,

00:04:09.636 --> 00:04:12.676
worth over 20 billion dollars a year,

00:04:12.676 --> 00:04:15.836
is just 1.1 million tonnes.

00:04:17.156 --> 00:04:18.396
1.1 million tonnes.

00:04:19.836 --> 00:04:21.436
Now, scope three,

00:04:21.436 --> 00:04:23.076
the third scope,

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:24.276
this is a bit harder.

00:04:24.276 --> 00:04:29.316
This is all the indirect emissions
from how people use your products

00:04:29.316 --> 00:04:30.676
or from your supply chain.